        "original_id": "b5b189b0-6f59-51af-a78e-9391a99f9a08",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kadeem Jack, David Stern\n- Organizations: NBA G League, NBA D-League, Sioux Falls Skyforce, NBA\n- Roles: professional basketball player, NBA commissioner\n\nFacts:\n- In March 2005, NBA commissioner David Stern announced a plan to expand the NBA D-League from eight teams to fifteen teams and develop it into a true minor league farm system.\n- The plan announced by David Stern said each NBA D-League team would be affiliated with one or more NBA teams.\n- Kadeem Jack was born on October 27, 1992.\n- Kadeem Jack is an American professional basketball player.\n- Kadeem Jack plays for the Sioux Falls Skyforce of the NBA G League.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
